ical-hacks/help","site":"https://public-api.wordpress.com/rest/v1.1/sites/156670177"}},"parent":0}}},{"ID":1160258,"author":{"ID":149446917,"login":"zoeskyforest","email":false,"name":"Zoe Skyforest","first_name":"Zoe","last_name":"Skyforest","nice_name":"zoeskyforest","URL":"","avatar_URL":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/c8a1968e22e48851ee02109004283f97707fe5c9859f87ecaec42409bcb09ac4?s=96&d=mm","profile_URL":"https://gravatar.com/b0a8b5113a3a3484870df108867cbd02"},"date":"2026-09-10T04:00:38-07:00","title":"Open Source Acoustic Drone Detection","URL":"https://hackaday.com/2026/09/10/open-source-acoustic-drone-detection/","excerpt":"<p>Drones have become a potent military threat, particularly on the small scale. Nimble multi-rotor drones are fast, difficult to spot, and can cause plenty of harm if allowed to go <a href=\"https://hackaday.com/2026/09/10/open-source-acoustic-drone-detection/\" class=\"read-more\">&hellip;read more</a></p>\n","featured_image":"https://hackaday.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/8874001788869712843-e1788947193344.jpg","categories":{"drone hacks":{"ID":107827385,"name":"drone hacks","slug":"drone-hacks","description":"","post_count":538,"meta":{"links":{"self":"https://public-api.wordpress.com/rest/v1.1/sites/156670177/categories/slug:drone-hacks","help":"https://public-api.wordpress.com/rest/v1.1/sites/156670177/categories/slug:drone-hacks/help","site":"https://public-api.wordpress.com/rest/v1.1/sites/156670177"}},"parent":0}}},{"ID":1160389,"author":{"ID":149446899,"login":"TylerAugust","email":false,"name":"Tyler August","first_name":"Tyler","last_name":"August","nice_name":"tyleraugust","URL":"","avatar_URL":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/c0796b889a3d3c0a39085c578a29334b50aa1db00038ae861668d8fcff52c254?s=96&d=mm","profile_URL":"https://gravatar.com/241b86f6d12667d7ecedc869bdae1b85"},"date":"2026-09-10T01:00:49-07:00","title":"If It&#8217;s Electronic Paper, Why Not Print To It?","URL":"https://hackaday.com/2026/09/10/if-its-electronic-paper-why-not-print-to-it/","excerpt":"<p>E-ink is supposed to be the electronic version of dead-tree paper, but there&#8217;s one enormous difference: how you get your images and text onto it. For paper, you print on <a href=\"https://hackaday.com/2026/09/10/if-its-electronic-paper-why-not-print-to-it/\" class=\"read-more\">&hellip;read more</a></p>\n","featured_image":"https://hackaday.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/penguin-printer.CsBOkScT_2bj2ld.webp","categories":{"computer hacks":{"ID":568165,"name":"computer hacks","slug":"computer-hacks","description":"computer  hacks\r\n","post_count":1488,"meta":{"links":{"self":"https://public-api.wordpress.com/rest/v1.1/sites/156670177/categories/slug:computer-hacks","help":"https://public-api.wordpress.com/rest/v1.1/sites/156670177/categories/slug:computer-hacks/help","site":"https://public-api.wordpress.com/rest/v1.1/sites/156670177"}},"parent":0},"Peripherals Hacks":{"ID":10969081,"name":"Peripherals Hacks","slug":"peripherals-hacks","description":"","post_count":1574,"meta":{"links":{"self":"https://public-api.wordpress.com/rest/v1.1/sites/156670177/categories/slug:peripherals-hacks","help":"https://public-api.wordpress.com/rest/v1.1/sites/156670177/categories/slug:peripherals-hacks/help","site":"https://public-api.wordpress.com/rest/v1.1/sites/156670177"}},"parent":0}}},{"ID":1160255,"author":{"ID":149446917,"login":"zoeskyforest","email":false,"name":"Zoe Skyforest","first_name":"Zoe","last_name":"Skyforest","nice_name":"zoeskyforest","URL":"","avatar_URL":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/c8a1968e22e48851ee02109004283f97707fe5c9859f87ecaec42409bcb09ac4?s=96&d=mm","profile_URL":"https://gravatar.com/b0a8b5113a3a3484870df108867cbd02"},"date":"2026-09-09T22:00:16-07:00","title":"Origami Sensors That You Can Wear","URL":"https://hackaday.com/2026/09/09/origami-sensors-that-you-can-wear/","excerpt":"<p>Origami is a wonderful art form, but as a new project from the Shibaura Institute of Technology demonstrates, it can also have applications in the world of wearable tech. The <a href=\"https://hackaday.com/2026/09/09/origami-sensors-that-you-can-wear/\" class=\"read-more\">&hellip;read more</a></p>\n","featured_image":"https://hackaday.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Screenshot-2026-09-09-202135-2.png","categories":{"Wearable Hacks":{"ID":12552193,"name":"Wearable Hacks","slug":"wearable-hacks","description":"","post_count":869,"meta":{"links":{"self":"https://public-api.wordpress.com/rest/v1.1/sites/156670177/categories/slug:wearable-hacks","help":"https://public-api.wordpress.com/rest/v1.1/sites/156670177/categories/slug:wearable-hacks/help","site":"https://public-api.wordpress.com/rest/v1.1/sites/156670177"}},"parent":0}}},{"ID":1160253,"author":{"ID":149446917,"login":"zoeskyforest","email":false,"name":"Zoe Skyforest","first_name":"Zoe","last_name":"Skyforest","nice_name":"zoeskyforest","URL":"","avatar_URL":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/c8a1968e22e48851ee02109004283f97707fe5c9859f87ecaec42409bcb09ac4?s=96&d=mm","profile_URL":"https://gravatar.com/b0a8b5113a3a3484870df108867cbd02"},"date":"2026-09-09T19:00:42-07:00","title":"3D Printable Lenticular Indicators","URL":"https://hackaday.com/2026/09/09/3d-printable-lenticular-indicators/","excerpt":"<p>You can 3D print all kinds of things, from Yoda heads to little models of Pikachu. Eventually, though, most of us get to a point where we want to print <a href=\"https://hackaday.com/2026/09/09/3d-printable-lenticular-indicators/\" class=\"read-more\">&hellip;read more</a></p>\n","featured_image":"https://hackaday.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/KJK-DvgmRNs-HD.jpg","categories":{"3d Printer hacks":{"ID":114554125,"name":"3d Printer hacks","slug":"3d-printer-hacks","description":"","post_count":2872,"meta":{"links":{"self":"https://public-api.wordpress.com/rest/v1.1/sites/156670177/categories/slug:3d-printer-hacks","help":"https://public-api.wordpress.com/rest/v1.1/sites/156670177/categories/slug:3d-printer-hacks/help","site":"https://public-api.wordpress.com/rest/v1.1/sites/156670177"}},"parent":0}}},{"ID":1160342,"author":{"ID":149446899,"login":"TylerAugust","email":false,"name":"Tyler August","first_name":"Tyler","last_name":"August","nice_name":"tyleraugust","URL":"","avatar_URL":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/c0796b889a3d3c0a39085c578a29334b50aa1db00038ae861668d8fcff52c254?s=96&d=mm","profile_URL":"https://gravatar.com/241b86f6d12667d7ecedc869bdae1b85"},"date":"2026-09-09T16:00:11-07:00","title":"Local LLMs Can Work Better Than Claude, At Least For Some","URL":"https://hackaday.com/2026/09/09/local-llms-can-work-better-than-claude-at-least-for-some/","excerpt":"<p>This is going to be a very personal question, because when you&#8217;re talking cloud vs local anything, it comes down to this: how much are you willing to pay for <a href=\"https://hackaday.com/2026/09/09/local-llms-can-work-better-than-claude-at-least-for-some/\" class=\"read-more\">&hellip;read more</a></p>\n","featured_image":"https://hackaday.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/GithubCopilot.jpg","categories":{"Artificial Intelligence":{"ID":422589899,"name":"Artificial Intelligence","slug":"artificial-intelligence","description":"","post_count":346,"meta":{"links":{"self":"https://public-api.wordpress.com/rest/v1.1/sites/156670177/categories/slug:artificial-intelligence","help":"https://public-api.wordpress.com/rest/v1.1/sites/156670177/categories/slug:artificial-intelligence/help","site":"https://public-api.wordpress.com/rest/v1.1/sites/156670177"}},"parent":0},"Software Development":{"ID":2301,"name":"Software Development","slug":"software-development","description":"","post_count":869,"meta":{"links":{"self":"https://public-api.wordpress.com/rest/v1.1/sites/156670177/categories/slug:software-development","help":"https://public-api.wordpress.com/rest/v1.1/sites/156670177/categories/slug:software-development/help","site":"https://public-api.wordpress.com/rest/v1.1/sites/156670177"}},"parent":0}}},{"ID":11602