/hackaday.com/2026/09/09/its-gnu-radio-companion-but-in-the-browser/","excerpt":"<p>The progression of the web browser from a tool for simple static information browsing into a do-everything computing environment has been inexorable, with package after package making the jump. Today <a href=\"https://hackaday.com/2026/09/09/its-gnu-radio-companion-but-in-the-browser/\" class=\"read-more\">&hellip;read more</a></p>\n","featured_image":"https://hackaday.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/gnu-radio-web-featured.jpg","categories":{"Radio Hacks":{"ID":23971578,"name":"Radio Hacks","slug":"radio-hacks","description":"","post_count":1496,"meta":{"links":{"self":"https://public-api.wordpress.com/rest/v1.1/sites/156670177/categories/slug:radio-hacks","help":"https://public-api.wordpress.com/rest/v1.1/sites/156670177/categories/slug:radio-hacks/help","site":"https://public-api.wordpress.com/rest/v1.1/sites/156670177"}},"parent":0},"Software Hacks":{"ID":3796421,"name":"Software Hacks","slug":"software-hacks","description":"","post_count":1123,"meta":{"links":{"self":"https://public-api.wordpress.com/rest/v1.1/sites/156670177/categories/slug:software-hacks","help":"https://public-api.wordpress.com/rest/v1.1/sites/156670177/categories/slug:software-hacks/help","site":"https://public-api.wordpress.com/rest/v1.1/sites/156670177"}},"parent":0}}},{"ID":1160343,"author":{"ID":62600045,"login":"hexagon5un","email":false,"name":"Elliot Williams","first_name":"Elliot","last_name":"Williams","nice_name":"hexagon5un","URL":"https://hackaday.io/hexagon5un","avatar_URL":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3b51d5210b622e62b2d80ce4cfa09f0d74a512cb8897f1e5b5f3de17a27e1b56?s=96&d=mm","profile_URL":"https://gravatar.com/7bab69657ce4aefefe6b10569b578718"},"date":"2026-09-09T08:18:03-07:00","title":"Hunting the Wild Vibrotruck","URL":"https://hackaday.com/2026/09/09/hunting-the-wild-vibrotruck/","excerpt":"<p>A few weeks ago, my wife was out walking the dog, and she sent me four or five photos of sma